{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>QR Code Pro 是一款集掃描與製作於一身的 QR Code 工具，適合需要快速讀取條碼、NFC 標籤，或自行建立 QR Code 的用戶。App 原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>二維碼掃描與製作</h2>\n<p>可快速掃描 QR Code、條碼及 NFC 標籤，對應 13 種格式，支援超廣角相機及批次掃描，同時讀取多個代碼。開啟掃描所得連結前會先檢查可疑網址；建立 QR Code 時可加入自訂顏色、眼睛形狀、瞳孔樣式及標誌，適用於網站、Wi-Fi、聯絡人與行事曆等場合。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-268-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-269-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-270-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-271-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-272-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-273-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QR Code Pro: scan, generate</li>\n<li>應用類別：Shopping</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T13:38:32.717001+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}